  "passes": 1,
  "note": "Kloveniersburgwal 100-102 and 90-92 (even, canal side): two late-19th-c. neo-Renaissance fronts of red brick with white speklagen, segmental relieving arches over every window and a bracketed cornice; a stepped wall gable over the middle of 100-102, two white dormers on 90-92. Run cut out of kloveniersburgwal-80-158 (the wide buildings either side are large-tier)."
 },
